{
  "id": "ROM.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Romans 9",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paul's Anguish Over Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I speak the truth in Christ—I am not lying, my conscience confirms it through the Holy Spirit—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have great sorrow and unceasing anguish in my heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I could wish that I myself were cursed and cut off from Christ for the sake of my people, those of my own race,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the people of Israel. Theirs is the adoption to sonship; theirs the divine glory, the covenants, the receiving of the law, the temple worship and the promises.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Theirs are the patriarchs, and from them is traced the human ancestry of the Messiah, who is God over all, forever praised!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "God's Sovereign Choice",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is not as though God's word had failed. For not all who are descended from Israel are Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nor because they are his descendants are they all Abraham's children. On the contrary, \"It is through Isaac that your offspring will be reckoned.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In other words, it is not the children by physical descent who are God's children, but it is the children of the promise who are regarded as Abraham's offspring.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this was how the promise was stated: \"At the appointed time I will return, and Sarah will have a son.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not only that, but Rebekah's children were conceived at the same time by our father Isaac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet, before the twins were born or had done anything good or bad—in order that God's purpose in election might stand:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not by works but by him who calls—she was told, \"The older will serve the younger.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Just as it is written: \"Jacob I loved, but Esau I hated.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What then shall we say? Is God unjust? Not at all!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he says to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will have mercy on whom I have mercy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and I will have compassion on whom I have compassion.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It does not, therefore, depend on human desire or effort, but on God's mercy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Scripture says to Pharaoh: \"I raised you up for this very purpose, that I might display my power in you and that my name might be proclaimed in all the earth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore God has mercy on whom he wants to have mercy, and he hardens whom he wants to harden.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of you will say to me: \"Then why does God still blame us? For who is able to resist his will?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But who are you, a human being, to talk back to God? \"Shall what is formed say to the one who formed it, 'Why did you make me like this?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Does not the potter have the right to make out of the same lump of clay some pottery for special purposes and some for common use?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What if God, although choosing to show his wrath and make his power known, bore with great patience the objects of his wrath—prepared for destruction?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What if he did this to make the riches of his glory known to the objects of his mercy, whom he prepared in advance for glory—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even us, whom he also called, not only from the Jews but also from the Gentiles?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As he says in Hosea:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will call them 'my people' who are not my people;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and I will call her 'my loved one' who is not my loved one,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"In the very place where it was said to them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'You are not my people,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "there they will be called 'children of the living God.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaiah cries out concerning Israel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Though the number of the Israelites be like the sand by the sea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "only the remnant will be saved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the Lord will carry out",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his sentence on earth with speed and finality.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is just as Isaiah said previously:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Unless the Lord Almighty",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "had left us descendants,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "we would have become like Sodom,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "we would have been like Gomorrah.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Israel's Unbelief",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What then shall we say? That the Gentiles, who did not pursue righteousness, have obtained it, a righteousness that is by faith;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but the people of Israel, who pursued the law as the way of righteousness, have not attained their goal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why not? Because they pursued it not by faith but as if it were by works. They stumbled over the stumbling stone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As it is written:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"See, I lay in Zion a stone that causes people to stumble",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and a rock that makes them fall,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the one who believes in him will never be put to shame.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
